              },
              {
                "id": "q-web-0002",
                "kind": "element_name",
                "target": "WebsiteConfiguration.RoutingRules",
                "summary": "The routing rules are wrapped: the list sits inside a RoutingRules element with one RoutingRule per entry, where every list in the notification family is flattened, and a flattened rendering here is a document SDKs read as having no rules.",
